  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1189523/description_6488e172-95fe-46d0-b211-c47ba4ba1b76.png\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1189523/description_b45b4497-b99b-478b-bb78-816ecf83e727.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1189523/description_4bd2641e-5eea-4372-ad16-c23019a5a43e.png\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1189523/description_4b74b831-b235-42c6-ab80-34dd9c3f2ce1.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1189523/description_a2e4b377-84ff-4037-8f79-7e1a07b626ec.png\" alt=\"\"></p><hr><h2><strong>数据包支持</strong></h2><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1189523/description_97ed6f11-026f-449b-97ee-86e1500c2794.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>你可以通过数据包自定义本模组中的几乎所有内容，包括：</p><ul>\n<li>自定义超级进化形态</li>\n<li>极巨化（G-Max）形态</li>\n<li>自定义宝可梦属性</li>\n<li>以及更多内容</li>\n</ul><p>📖 维基百科：\n<a href=\"https://github.com/yajatkaul/CobblemonMegaShowdown/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/yajatkaul/CobblemonMegaShowdown/wiki</a></p><hr><h2><strong>饰品整合</strong></h2><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1189523/description_b8f1e56c-7f90-47dd-948c-e096d5b53918.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1189523/description_231b647f-88e3-485a-b07f-1ed063068956.png\" alt=\"\"></p><hr><h2><strong>特性</strong></h2><ul>\n<li><p>可数据包化的特性</p></li>\n<li><p>外观支持</p></li>\n<li><p>所有形态变化</p></li>\n<li><p>支持骑乘</p></li>\n<li><p>全部48种超级进化形态</p></li>\n<li><p>饰品支持</p></li>\n<li><p>新增原始回归形态</p></li>\n<li><p>新增对战机制：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>太晶化玩法</li>\n<li>超级进化</li>\n<li>Z招式</li>\n<li>极巨化</li>\n<li>究极爆发</li></ul></li>\n<li><p>所有融合宝可梦</p></li>\n</ul><hr><h2><strong>致谢</strong></h2><p>所有致谢及模型使用详情均列于此：\n👉 <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1VPRia2W_7wqhbwSGv1845qmXw_FtjZ4FDhr58fRZFSM/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1VPRia2W_7wqhbwSGv1845qmXw_FtjZ4FDhr58fRZFSM/edit?usp=sharing</a></p><hr><h2><strong>不兼容性</strong></h2><p>已知不兼容的附加包/数据包：\n👉 <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1pVLaT_dkQnQ2oO1IrJwf0RzkZNgqds2RMlYYOtqBVGg/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1pVLaT_dkQnQ2oO1IrJwf0RzkZNgqds2RMlYYOtqBVGg/edit?usp=sharing</a></p><hr><h2><strong>社交平台</strong></h2><p>本模组包含了所有已存在的超级进化形态。如有任何帮助或疑问，欢迎加入我的Discord服务器：</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/egeWG4GXhN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/8a41e45e-aac9-44e5-8b69-55a81058ecbf_875x280.png\" alt=\"加入我们的Discord\"></a></p>",
